#!/usr/bin/python3
# prime:summary=coming from Windows or macOS: import files, bookmarks, apps and shortcuts
"""prime-switch — Switching from Windows or macOS to Prime Linux.

Provides:
  1. App Equivalents (Explorer/Finder -> Files, Spotlight, Task Manager -> Prime Control…)
  2. Import Browser Bookmarks & ~/Documents / ~/Pictures from a mounted drive
  3. Ctrl vs Cmd (Windows vs macOS) shortcut mode toggle
  4. Viewable & Printable Keybind Parity Table (Windows / macOS / Prime Linux)

Flags:
  prime-switch                  open the window
  prime-switch --tab=parity     open directly on the Keybind Parity Table
  prime-switch --export-html F  write printable HTML keybind parity sheet to F
  prime-switch --check          headless selftest (never maps a window)
  prime-switch --screenshots D  render all 4 tabs offscreen to PNGs in D
"""
